From 7ca91e91c6b678d6bbff7dc6ee0e36f86c44ccd6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joethedev5 <deepsbx1@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:23:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/20] Recover tcp_rbbr_rwnd_init and add t_rbbr_state to
 tcpcb

Disassembly shows the reference computes the initial RBBR window as
10 * MSS, rounds it down to an MSS multiple, clamps it to the maximum
window allowed by rcv_scale, and marks the window change pending.
The multiplier (10) is read from 0xfffffe0007cbf450 in the reference
image.

Add the missing 13432 tcpcb member t_rbbr_state between t_rlstate and
rcv_srtt, and include each reconstructed header from its matching new
source file.

Remaining explicit stubs: 308.

Authored-By: joethedev5 <joeshmo@nunya.com>
